Current Limitations

This is a prototype and several components are simulated or simplified.

Smartphone is currently used as the GPS source instead of a dedicated GPS
module.
Classroom positioning is demonstrated using ESP8266 nodes.
Wi-Fi communication is used for the prototype.
GPS coordinates shown in the current demonstration code may be test data.
The system has not yet been packaged into a wearable enclosure.
Power management and battery integration are not part of the current
prototype.

